<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine 1996/97 maize sales 4.39 mln T - source.</title>
<headline>Argentine 1996/97 maize sales 4.39 mln T - source.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine exporters had sold 4.39 million tonnes of maize by February 20, a market source said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The source provided the following table of sales (figures in tonnes):</p>
<p>    Chile	    60,000</p>
<p>    Colombia	200,000</p>
<p>    Cuba	    150,000</p>
<p>    Egypt	   260,000</p>
<p>    Indonesia     200,000</p>
<p>    Iran	    700,000</p>
<p>    Italy	   100,000</p>
<p>    Japan	   190,000</p>
<p>    Korea	 1,100,000</p>
<p>    Malaysia	300,000</p>
<p>    Morocco	  30,000</p>
<p>    Peru	     50,000</p>
<p>    Spain	    50,000</p>
<p>    Taiwan	  250,000</p>
<p>    Thailand	 50,000</p>
<p>    Tunisia	  50,000</p>
<p>    Turkey	  100,000</p>
<p>    Venezuela     300,000</p>
<p>    West Africa   100,000</p>
<p>    Others	  150,000</p>
<p>    Total	 4,390,000</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
